{"kind":"table","sheet":"Template","address":"A1:E37","rows":37,"cols":5,"values":[["It is recommended that you do not edit rubrics in spreadsheet format",null,null,null,null],["v1.0-s",null,null,null,null],["Hardware Connections",null,null,null,null],["Connects the RFID reader and selects the correct LED, uses the correct switch configuration for the project.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Connects the RFID reader and selects the correct LED, uses the correct switch configuration for the project.","12 pts: Connects most components correctly, but one connection or configuration is missing, loose, or incorrect.","8 pts: Connects some components correctly, but the circuit or configuration is incomplete or unstable,","4 pts: Circuit is mostly incomplete, incorrectly connected, or unsafe to test."],["Code and Arduino Knowledge",null,null,null,null],["Understanding of code and Arduino IDE. Uploads and starts the sketch, detects the RFID card, activates the LED correctly, and works consistently across repeated scans.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Understanding of code and Arduino IDE. Uploads and starts the sketch, detects the RFID card, activates the LED correctly, and works consistently across repeated scans.","12 pts: Understanding of code and Arduino IDE. System works mostly as expected, but one function is incomplete or inconsistent.","8 pts: Limited of code and Arduino IDE. System shows partial functionality, but RFID detection or the LED response does not work reliably.","4 pts: Limited of code and Arduino IDE or the system does not demonstrate the required RFID-to-LED response."],["Four-Slide Content",null,null,null,null],["Explains the project purpose, how RFID works, the circuit/code and LED response, and sensor ubiquity with at least 3 modern examples.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Explains the project purpose, how RFID works, the circuit/code and LED response, and sensor ubiquity with at least 3 modern examples.","12 pts: Explains most required topics and includes at least 2 modern examples of sensor use.","8 pts: Includes some required information, but important explanations or examples are missing or inaccurate.","4 pts: Includes very limited relevant information about RFID, the project, or sensor ubiquity."],["Presentation and Explanation",null,null,null,null],["Presents in English for 1–2 minutes, demonstrates the system, correctly explains input-process-output, and explains the LED response.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Presents in English for 1–2 minutes, demonstrates the system, correctly explains input-process-output, and explains the LED response.","12 pts: Presents in English and demonstrates the system, but the presentation is slightly outside the 1–2 minute limit or one explanation is incomplete or unclear.","8 pts: Gives a short or incomplete presentation, is clearly outside the 1–2 minute limit, or shows limited understanding of how the system works.","4 pts: Does not adequately demonstrate or explain how the system works and does not meet the required presentation time."],["Questions",null,null,null,null],["Answers correctly all 4 questions related to the presentations.",null,null,null,null],[null,16,12,8,4],[null,"16 points","12 points","8 points","4 points"],[null,"16 pts: Answers correctly all 4 questions related to the presentations.","12 pts: Answers correctly at least two questions related to the presentations.","8 pts: Answers correctly at least one questions related to the presentations.","4 pts: Answers correctly at least one question related to the presentations."],["Punctuality and Preparation",null,null,null,null],["Finishes and submits on time, brings required materials and login information, and uses class time for the assigned project.",null,null,null,null],[null,5,2,null,null],[null,"5 points","2 points",null,null],[null,"5 pts: Finishes and submits on time, brings required materials and login information, and uses class time for the assigned project.","2 pts: Does not finish or submit on time, is missing required materials or login information, or repeatedly uses class time for unrelated work.",null,null],["Lab Responsibility",null,null,null,null],["Handles the Arduino and components safely, keeps the workspace organized, follows instructions, and returns all materials correctly.",null,null,null,null],[null,5,2,null,null],[null,"5 points","2 points",null,null],[null,"5 pts: Handles the Arduino and components safely, keeps the workspace organized, follows instructions, and returns all materials correctly.","2 pts: Handles equipment unsafely, ignores instructions, leaves the workspace disorganized, or does not return materials correctly.",null,null]]}
